**Merge legacy `debt.jsonl` first so it cannot override newer harvest snapshots.**

Line 235 currently appends legacy data after `harvests/*.jsonl`. For duplicate `thread_id`s, `upsertRecords()` treats legacy rows as the newest input and can overwrite fresh harvest state (including reopened threads) with stale legacy fields.



